"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nWe arrived early at Victoria Market and stopped by the cafe in String Bean Alley near the entrance to enjoy a quiet moment before the market opened.  \nOrdered a Long Black to go, sat outside for a bit, and soaked in the morning calm.  \n\nThe taste wasn't anything special, but it was a reminder that Australian coffee is reliably above average no matter where you go.  \n\n\n\nLeague of Honest Coffee team runs this place, using Padre beans.  \n\nIt was the perfect little pit stop before exploring the market.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"